# Loaded by `supabase start` into the LOCAL edge runtime only; nothing
# deploys this file. The value is not a secret: it is what the test suite
# (tests/payments.test.ts) sends as RevenueCat would.
#
# The hosted project gets its own value, the one typed into RevenueCat's
# webhook settings, with `npx supabase secrets set REVENUECAT_WEBHOOK_AUTH=...`
# (docs/payments-setup.md). Never `secrets set --env-file` this file.
REVENUECAT_WEBHOOK_AUTH=Bearer local-stack-only
